message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Idea Evaluator: a Claude Code plugin for evidence-based startup idea evaluation"
abstract: "An open-source Claude Code plugin that evaluates a startup idea with public evidence and returns DEAD, ALIVE or INSUFFICIENT_DATA. Research agents collect findings with verbatim quotes that code verifies on the source page, a kill-check agent searches for the cause of death, an auditor rechecks decisive quotes, a deterministic rule turns a pattern sheet into the verdict, and an author-blind judge gives a second opinion."
